{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34382","headline":"袭美以纱巾见惠继以雅音因次韵酬谢 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美以纱巾见惠继以雅音因次韵酬谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薄如蝉翅背斜阳，不称春前赠𦊔郎\n初觉顶寒生远吹，预忧头白透新霜。\n堪窥水槛澄波影，好拂花墙亚蘂香。\n知有芙蓉留自戴，欲峨烟雾访黄房。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34382.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34382","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}